{
  "id": 616,
  "description": "The undead haunt the forests, abberations fester the outlands, and remnants of the Abyss threaten the material plane, but we will not wait for their arrival. We stalk them in their domains, hunt them from within, for we are the Gloomstalkers. Why wait for an assault, when we can BE the assault?\n\n==========================\n\nThis Guild is meant for those who simply enjoy playing IdleMMO and for those who may enjoy some light roleplay within the game. All levels and skills are welcome, provided you put them to great use towards Challenges and Raids.\n\n==========================\n\nChallenges are available Daily; Thursday is CL:25+ Raids and Fridays are CL:40+ Raids.\n\n==========================\n\n**Join the Discord to chat!**\n\n**https://discord.gg/SG5ezkXu**",
